WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:17.060
One hundred years before Aegon's Conquest,
Targaryen's ancestral home of the old Valyria

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.410
was destroyed,
killing all the dragon lords with only one

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.189
of the weaker dragon families, Targaryens,
surviving.

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:27.000
Thanks to Daenys the Dreamer who saw the doom
in her dream

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.340
and warned her Lord father to leave before
it's too late, Targaryens survived and came

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.710
to Westeros.
This however is a legend and might not be

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.550
the true reason why Targaryens left Valyria,
and we will definitely learn about it in the

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:45.100
upcoming Game of Thrones prequel,
either through stories or flashbacks.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.800
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.699
to air in 2022.
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire

00:00:54.699 --> 00:00:59.210
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:03.600
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:08.210
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:13.360
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.500
Thats Fire And Blood volume 1. The yet unreleased
Fire And Vlood volume 2 will continue from

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:24.900
where part 1 ended, with Rhaenyra Targaryen's
son Aegon lll's reign and will cover Blackyre

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.520
rebellions, war with Dorne and go all the
way to the Mad King and Robert's Rebellion

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.049
that ended Targaryen dynasty.
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:01:34.049 --> 00:01:39.270
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.649
producer.
Aegon's Conquest is not the first great thing

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:46.619
Targaryens did.
100 years before, they were the only ones

00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:50.409
of all the dragon lords to survive the Doom
of Valyria.

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:55.010
It's often referred to simply as "The Doom"
- due to its massive destruction and historical

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.649
impact,
most people across the world understand that

00:01:58.649 --> 00:02:02.740
this specifically refers to the disaster which
struck Valyria.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:07.790
The Doom of Valyria, often called the Doom,
was a cataclysm of an unspecified nature that

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:13.400
caused the collapse of the Valyrian Freehold,
which had prospered for five thousand years.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:17.410
Spells, knowledge, and recorded history were
lost in the Doom,

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:22.160
and the Century of Blood followed the disaster.
For nearly five thousand years, the Valyrian

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:28.220
Freehold had remained the dominant power in
the continent of Essos, thanks to their dragons,

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:33.040
mighty beasts that were a key to their power.
At its height, the Valyrian Freehold ruled

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:38.450
most of Essos - from Pentos to Meereen –
constituting about half of the known world.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:43.930
However, one fateful day, four hundred years
ago a cataclysm - which became known in later

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.940
years simply as "the Doom" - laid waste to
the Valyrian capital, its people, all the

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:54.010
dragons and the surrounding lands. The string
of volcanoes near Valyria known as the Fourteen

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:59.950
Fires exploded in a massive eruption, consuming
the city of Valyria in ash and flame, and

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:05.790
the entire region was wracked by corresponding
earthquakes. The Valyrian Peninsula itself

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.920
was shattered and the ocean came sweeping
in,

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.750
becoming the area now known as the Smoking
Sea –

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.510
which no sailor dares cross and which is believed
to be haunted by demons.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:21.570
Twelve years before the Doom, Lord Aenar Targaryen's
maiden daughter, Daenys the Dreamer,

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:26.220
had a powerful prophetic dream along with
visions that Valyria would be destroyed.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:30.850
Foreseeing the Doom, she convinced her father
to leave Valyria before the cataclysm.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:35.799
Aenar set sail, moving House Targaryen and
their property and their five dragons to the

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:41.870
island Dragonstone. On the day of the Doom,
every hill for five hundred miles exploded,

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:46.310
filling the air with ash and smoke and fire,
which killed even dragons.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:52.449
Earthquakes destroyed palaces, temples, and
towns, while lakes boiled or turned to acid.

00:03:52.449 --> 00:03:57.639
The Fourteen Flames, the fiery mountains of
Valyria, sent molten rock a thousand feet

00:03:57.639 --> 00:04:01.620
into the air,
and red clouds rained down dragonglass.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:06.890
It destroyed the city of Old Valyria and devastated
most of the surrounding Valyrian Peninsula.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:11.239
The destruction of its capital city in a single
day in turn caused the fall of the entire

00:04:11.239 --> 00:04:16.030
Valyrian Freehold, which for thousands of
years had ruled most of Essos.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:20.880
The proudest city in all the world was gone
in an instant, its fabled empire vanished

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:24.880
in a day.
Valar morghulis was how they said it in Valyria

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.970
of old. All men must die.
And the Doom came and proved it true.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:34.610
The cataclysm fragmented the Valyrian peninsula
surrounding Valyria into numerous smaller

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:38.480
islands
and creating the Smoking Sea between them.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.770
East of Valyria, Velos and Ghozai on the Isle
of Cedars were destroyed by a tsunami.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:48.750
The exact cause of the Doom remains unknown:
some believe the volcanic eruption was a natural

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:55.040
disaster, while others believe it was inadvertently
triggered by the Valyrians' own sorcery.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:59.630
Septon Barth and some maesters believe that
Valyrian spells controlling the Fourteen Flames

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:05.700
faltered. Other explanations include the curse
of Garin the Great, the fire of R'hllor,

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.430
or infighting dragonlords assassinating fire
mages.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:13.890
Whatever the cause, Valyria was destroyed,
and all their dragons were lost with it,

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:17.390
along with Valyrian recorded history, spells,
and knowledge.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.850
With its center of power destroyed, the Freehold
collapsed.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:26.930
Of the mighty families of dragonlords who
ruled the Freehold, only one survived, House

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:32.010
Targaryen, which had re-established itself
on Dragonstone in Westeros years before the

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.130
Doom.
Most importantly, the Targaryens on Dragonstone

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:40.370
possessed the only Valyrian dragons that survived
the Doom, the only remaining dragons in the

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:45.880
known world. As I said in the beginning, according
to legend, Lord Aenar Targaryen abandoned

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:49.790
Valyria with his family
because his daughter Daenys the Dreamer foresaw

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:54.220
the destruction in her dream,
but that might not be the true reason.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:06:00.090
As Viserys Targaryen says, it's just as likely
that Aenar met with some mishap at court

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:05.150
and chose exile over execution. Much of Essos
fell into chaos after the Doom.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:10.230
With the heartland of the Freehold destroyed,
its surviving colonies to the west and east

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:15.230
re-asserted their independence, politically
fracturing the continent and initiating a

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:19.450
series of savage wars for dominance known
as the "Century of Blood",

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:24.750
during which Volantis attempted to reform
the Valyrian empire under their rule.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.580
Several of these colonies formed into the
Free Cities in the west,

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.750
and the cities of Slaver's Bay in the east.
Meanwhile, without the Valyrians and their

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:38.060
dragons to keep them in check, the Dothraki
mounted hordes swept across the continent

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:42.920
from the central plains of the Dothraki Sea,
plundering and carving out new domains from

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.391
surrounding areas –
from the Dothraki point of view, the Doom

00:06:46.391 --> 00:06:50.180
started their own golden age of conquest and
expansion.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:54.990
In the far northwest of Essos, the hidden
city of Braavos, founded by escaped slaves

00:06:54.990 --> 00:07:00.210
who fled Valyria, now revealed itself to the
world. While the other Valyrian colonies were

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:03.750
left in chaos,
Braavos was an island of stability because

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.270
it had no political or economic ties with
the Freehold,

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:11.010
and quickly rose to become the most powerful
of the Free Cities.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:14.139
Some dragonlords in Lys and Tyrosh survived
the Doom,

00:07:14.139 --> 00:07:17.419
but they were soon killed along with their
dragons.

00:07:17.419 --> 00:07:20.540
The dragonlord Aurion declared himself Emperor
of Valyria

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:26.850
and led a host from Qohor toward Valyria,
but he and his followers were not seen again.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:33.010
Tommen II Lannister, King of the Rock, vanished
while sailing to Valyria with his blade, Brightroar,

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.410
and Gerion Lannister later disappeared while
searching for Brightroar.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:41.510
It's thus said that no one has returned from
a journey to the ruins of Valyria,

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:47.050
and even the most hardened sailors shudder
at the thought of sailing to ruined Valyria.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:51.360
Many of Valyria's secrets, such as magic,
the method for creating Valyrian steel,

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:56.650
and ancient records were lost in the Doom.
The disaster is represented in art across

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:02.810
the known world. Songs are sung of the Doom.
Indirectly, the disaster led to the conquest

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:09.110
of the Seven Kingdoms of Westeros by House
Targaryen. In 54 AC during the reign of Jaehaerys

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:12.950
I Targaryen,
the Princess Aerea Targaryen disappeared from

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:17.630
Dragonstone with the dragon Balerion.
Balerion returned to King's Landing in 56

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:23.300
AC with a dying Aerea.
Septon Barth, who helped treat her, believed

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:28.280
that Balerion had taken Aerea to Valyria,
its birthplace. Because of her bizarre and

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:32.400
horrific death and the powerful dragon's mysterious
wounds,

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.579
King Jaehaerys made traveling to Valyria punishable
by execution,

00:08:36.579 --> 00:08:41.169
and prohibited ships that had visited the
area from docking in Westeros.

00:08:41.169 --> 00:08:50.100
Let's now listen to what George RR Martin
has to say about 

00:08:50.100 --> 00:10:47.200
the Doom.
For 

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.060
the end I'd like to read a poem about the
Doom, which in the books,

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:54.440
Tyrion Lannister quoted to Jorah Mormont:
"They held each other close and turned their

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:58.550
backs upon the end.
The hills that split asunder and the black

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:02.730
that ate the skies;
The flames that shot so high and hot that

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:06.250
even dragons burned;
Would never be the final sights that fell

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:10.640
upon their eyes.
A fly upon a wall, the waves the sea wind

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:14.740
whipped and churned —
The city of a thousand years, and all that

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:18.640
men had learned;
The Doom consumed it all alike, and neither

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:22.230
of them turned"
The Doom of Valyira, the true reason Targaryens

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:26.649
left just before it happened,
all of this and more will finally be explained

00:11:26.649 --> 00:11:30.550
in the upcoming Game of Thrones prequel,
House of the Dragon, coming in 2022 on HBO.

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:32.529
Let me know your thoughts about all of this
in the comment section down below.

00:11:32.529 --> 00:11:37.960
Thank you so much for watching and hope to
see you in the next one.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.480
Peace!

